# AICPA SOC 2 corpus: © AICPA, not redistributable (see corpus/README.md).
# Only Visua's manifest and structure notes are committed; the documents and
# everything derived from them (verbatim criteria, mappings, search chunks)
# stay in the local installation.
corpus/aicpa-soc2/**
!corpus/aicpa-soc2/manifest.json
!corpus/aicpa-soc2/STRUCTURE.md
packages/frameworks/data/aicpa-*.json
packages/frameworks/data/mappings/*tsc-2017*.json
packages/frameworks/data/chunks/aicpa-soc2.json
